WEBVTT

00:00:01.040 --> 00:00:05.980
<i>Ever since the moment we met,
she's shone brilliantly.</i>

00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:12.400
<i>Back then, I couldn't even look back at 
those eyes that looked straight at me.</i>

00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:14.860
This is for you.

00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:18.010
Why, thank you.

00:00:18.010 --> 00:00:22.040
Hibiki, this is Ekoda-san. 
She's our new neighbor.

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:23.760
We just moved in today.

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:25.460
It's nice to meet you, Hibiki-chan.

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:29.070
We have three children,

00:00:29.070 --> 00:00:32.020
but my sons are out shopping with their dad.

00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:35.300
Ren, go on and say hello.

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:38.790
Ekoda Ren.

00:00:38.790 --> 00:00:39.780
Nice to meet you.

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:42.190
Hibiki...

00:00:42.190 --> 00:00:46.200
I'm sorry. There aren't many 
girls her age around here.

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:48.400
I think she's just a little nervous.

00:00:48.870 --> 00:00:50.700
You'll be attending kindergarten together.

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:52.360
Make sure you show her around.

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:03.610
A dream?

00:01:04.050 --> 00:01:06.000
That brought back memories...

00:02:47.650 --> 00:02:49.160
Ren! Ren!

00:02:49.160 --> 00:02:50.480
Wake up!

00:02:50.880 --> 00:02:54.240
I've walked to school alone for the 
past month because I had no choice,

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:57.400
and something bad has 
happened every single time!

00:02:57.400 --> 00:03:00.070
I'm begging you!
Please walk to school with me!

00:03:04.560 --> 00:03:07.700
Fine! I'll go alone again today.

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:10.330
I'm really going.

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:15.790
Ren, you idiot!

00:03:15.790 --> 00:03:19.550
<b>Episode 5</b>

00:03:15.790 --> 00:03:19.550
<b>May 9</b>

00:03:15.790 --> 00:03:19.550
<b>Getting Lost on the Way to School</b>

00:03:21.590 --> 00:03:22.700
Damn that Ren.

00:03:22.700 --> 00:03:26.910
She has no idea how uneasy 
I've felt every morning.

00:03:26.910 --> 00:03:29.520
Doesn't she worry about me?

00:03:32.530 --> 00:03:34.440
Crying about it won't get me anywhere.

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:36.860
Today I'll get to school without getting lost!

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:48.520
Where am I?

00:03:53.940 --> 00:03:55.380
That's...

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:57.380
<i>Know thy enemy.</i>

00:03:57.940 --> 00:04:01.830
We haven't been able to spend 
much time together lately.

00:04:01.830 --> 00:04:04.090
A few minutes won't hurt, right?

00:04:07.010 --> 00:04:08.310
<i>Th-There he is.</i>

00:04:10.230 --> 00:04:14.010
<i>Every time I see him, he's always so handsome.</i>

00:04:16.030 --> 00:04:17.360
<i>He's dirty.</i>

00:04:17.880 --> 00:04:20.390
<i>No one's here since it's early morning, so...</i>

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:25.700
What are you doing over there?

00:04:27.270 --> 00:04:29.150
Huh? Hagyu-san?

00:04:29.150 --> 00:04:30.860
Why are you sneaking around?

00:04:30.860 --> 00:04:32.140
Is someone there?

00:04:32.140 --> 00:04:34.290
Th-There's no one else here.

00:04:36.340 --> 00:04:38.110
I thought you said there was no one here.

00:04:38.110 --> 00:04:39.380
Th-That's right.

00:04:40.510 --> 00:04:41.880
What's wrong with you?

00:04:41.880 --> 00:04:44.380
If there's nothing there, 
why would you try to hide it?

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:46.640
I-I'm not! No reason!

00:04:49.310 --> 00:04:50.060
Oh, no!

00:04:51.410 --> 00:04:54.750
Oh... There really isn't anyone here.

00:04:54.750 --> 00:04:55.850
How boring.

00:04:55.850 --> 00:04:57.740
Y-You're too close!

00:04:57.740 --> 00:04:59.230
Huh? To what?

00:05:01.080 --> 00:05:03.100
N-Nothing...

00:05:03.100 --> 00:05:04.740
You're weird.

00:05:05.110 --> 00:05:08.460
Hagyu-san, what are you doing 
here so early in the morning?

00:05:08.460 --> 00:05:10.040
It's still only 6:30.

00:05:10.040 --> 00:05:13.070
I always go to school at this time.

00:05:13.070 --> 00:05:14.560
Y-You do?

00:05:14.560 --> 00:05:17.680
It's Ren's fault for always 
sleeping in until the last minute.

00:05:17.680 --> 00:05:20.840
I need at least three hours 
if I'm walking to school alone.

00:05:21.190 --> 00:05:24.170
Three hours? Wh-Why?

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:33.320
I see. I'm sorry.

00:05:33.320 --> 00:05:34.800
Mind your own business!

00:05:34.800 --> 00:05:35.900
Sheesh...

00:05:35.900 --> 00:05:39.880
People have always told me 
that I have no sense of direction,

00:05:39.880 --> 00:05:41.520
but it's really not that bad.

00:05:41.520 --> 00:05:42.520
Oh, right.

00:05:43.270 --> 00:05:45.180
I wanted to thank you for the other day.

00:05:46.160 --> 00:05:47.930
I mean for helping with our homework.

00:05:47.930 --> 00:05:50.740
You knew about the flower 
of happiness, didn't you?

00:05:51.170 --> 00:05:53.240
Thanks, Hagyu-san.

00:05:56.530 --> 00:06:00.750
Y-You should be thanking Ren, not me.

00:06:00.750 --> 00:06:03.680
Ren's the one who got 
the old woman to tell you

00:06:03.680 --> 00:06:05.590
where the botanical garden was.

00:06:06.050 --> 00:06:10.880
Is she the reason the old woman's 
attitude suddenly changed?

00:06:10.880 --> 00:06:12.060
Of course.

00:06:12.060 --> 00:06:14.680
Ren... Ren is, well...

00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:18.100
She's extremely popular with women.

00:06:19.590 --> 00:06:24.520
W-Well, she certainly does seem 
like the cool, androgynous type.

00:06:24.520 --> 00:06:26.690
It's not that simple!

00:06:27.250 --> 00:06:29.580
You saw it. She attracts humans, of course,

00:06:29.580 --> 00:06:32.560
but also dogs, cats, birds, 
cows, tigers, and rabbits.

00:06:32.560 --> 00:06:36.720
For some reason, females of 
all species are drawn to Ren.

00:06:36.720 --> 00:06:39.240
As Ren's closest childhood friend,

00:06:39.240 --> 00:06:40.960
I've put up with it for years.

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:43.070
I see...

00:06:43.070 --> 00:06:45.420
Ren's appeal transcends species!

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:50.550
It's no wonder I'm in love—
I mean, consider her a dear friend.

00:06:50.550 --> 00:06:53.560
Considering how strange 
everyone else in Class 7 is,

00:06:53.560 --> 00:06:55.890
I can't say it's impossible.

00:06:55.890 --> 00:07:00.480
It's a trait that also causes her
a great deal of trouble.

00:07:00.930 --> 00:07:03.860
You'd better not ever fall in love with her.

00:07:05.070 --> 00:07:08.430
D-Don't worry about me. I already...

00:07:08.430 --> 00:07:09.500
Already?

00:07:09.500 --> 00:07:12.160
Oh, uh... It's nothing.

00:07:12.460 --> 00:07:17.160
Oh? What's this? You're already 
in love with someone?

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:20.060
N-No! Wh-What about you?

00:07:20.060 --> 00:07:21.530
Don't you like anyone?

00:07:21.530 --> 00:07:23.210
What? Me?

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:26.670
I-I don't have a-anyone like that.

00:07:27.120 --> 00:07:30.090
Then let's both stop talking about this.

00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:31.900
We'll get there pretty early,

00:07:31.900 --> 00:07:33.480
but do you want to go to school now?

00:07:34.130 --> 00:07:35.280
With you?

00:07:35.280 --> 00:07:38.390
If you get lost easily, it's probably for the best.

00:07:42.310 --> 00:07:44.350
There's no way I'd go with you!

00:07:45.510 --> 00:07:47.400
What's gotten into you?

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:49.690
Don't you remember what happened back then?

00:07:50.080 --> 00:07:52.080
Huh? When?

00:07:52.080 --> 00:07:55.490
I'll show you! I'll get to school on my own!

00:07:55.880 --> 00:07:57.770
Hey, wait!

00:08:00.100 --> 00:08:02.830
School is the other way...

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:04.550
Good work today.

00:08:10.960 --> 00:08:13.820
Where am I?

00:08:16.630 --> 00:08:19.220
Hey, that's...

00:08:22.850 --> 00:08:25.690
What's she doing in that alley?

00:08:27.240 --> 00:08:28.810
Meow, meow!

00:08:31.480 --> 00:08:32.860
<i>A cat alley?</i>

00:08:33.230 --> 00:08:35.860
Let me pet you just once today...

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:56.550
I have no regrets.

00:08:57.380 --> 00:09:01.510
Silly kitties. You're so shy.

00:09:01.510 --> 00:09:03.520
<i>That goes beyond being shy!</i>

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:07.550
This is my thousandth time 
coming down this kitty alley.

00:09:07.550 --> 00:09:10.730
Do they at least recognize me?

00:09:10.730 --> 00:09:12.580
I sure hope so.

00:09:13.940 --> 00:09:16.860
All right! Time to go to school!

00:09:18.560 --> 00:09:21.560
Is she in love with those cats?

00:09:21.560 --> 00:09:23.580
What a troubled girl.

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:25.580
Super Ultra Kitty Punch, meow!

00:09:42.430 --> 00:09:43.640
My pinky toe!

00:10:04.600 --> 00:10:06.860
I feel... anemic...

00:10:15.320 --> 00:10:19.310
This is that same construction site!

00:10:19.310 --> 00:10:21.320
Today's been a disaster, too!

00:10:21.320 --> 00:10:23.640
This is all Hibarigaoka's fault!

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:27.120
She nearly swayed me earlier, but...

00:10:27.800 --> 00:10:31.150
Just thinking about it makes my blood boil.

00:10:31.490 --> 00:10:35.290
I'll never forget the day of the entrance exam.

00:10:35.860 --> 00:10:38.280
I'm going to arrive first!

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:40.700
I left home early that day, too.

00:10:42.980 --> 00:10:48.550
She happened to pass by
when I was just a little lost,

00:10:49.800 --> 00:10:51.690
but when I worked up the courage

00:10:50.200 --> 00:10:51.050
It's that way.

00:10:51.690 --> 00:10:54.200
to ask for directions, my fate was sealed.

00:10:54.660 --> 00:10:56.100
All right!

00:10:56.690 --> 00:11:00.010
She dealt the finishing blow 
and got me completely lost.

00:11:00.010 --> 00:11:02.680
I was nearly late to the exam.

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:06.840
If I had failed that exam,

00:11:06.840 --> 00:11:09.930
Ren and I would've gone 
to different high schools.

00:11:09.930 --> 00:11:12.510
Just thinking about it terrifies me.

00:11:12.510 --> 00:11:13.720
I can't forgive her!

00:11:13.720 --> 00:11:16.100
I'll never forgive you, Hibarigaoka!

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:22.660
Is this Hibarigaoka's?

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:33.300
<i>What a perfect bow.</i>

00:11:51.010 --> 00:11:52.670
Good morning.

00:11:52.670 --> 00:11:53.150
Good m—

00:11:54.080 --> 00:11:55.080
What happened?

00:11:55.080 --> 00:11:56.650
Don't worry about me.

00:11:56.970 --> 00:11:59.320
Good morning, girls!

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:00.620
Oh, my!

00:12:00.110 --> 00:12:01.530
You're injured, too?

00:12:01.530 --> 00:12:02.840
Now we match.

00:12:02.840 --> 00:12:03.530
What?

00:12:03.890 --> 00:12:05.150
Thanks.

00:12:05.150 --> 00:12:06.780
You're welcome.

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:08.150
Shall we go?

00:12:12.460 --> 00:12:14.190
Oh, it's Ren-chan.

00:12:14.190 --> 00:12:15.170
Hey!

00:12:16.520 --> 00:12:18.380
Oh... Good morning.

00:12:18.380 --> 00:12:20.000
Good morning.

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:23.370
Huh? I heard you normally
get here at the last minute,

00:12:23.370 --> 00:12:25.100
but you're early today.

00:12:25.100 --> 00:12:27.140
Who told you that?

00:12:27.380 --> 00:12:31.050
Oh, I ran into Hagyu-san earlier.
She told me then.

00:12:31.050 --> 00:12:32.240
Hibiki?

00:12:32.240 --> 00:12:36.150
Yes, but she went running in the 
opposite direction of the school.

00:12:36.690 --> 00:12:39.130
I hope she makes it okay.

00:12:40.680 --> 00:12:42.150
She probably won't.

00:12:42.150 --> 00:12:43.440
Huh?

00:12:43.440 --> 00:12:48.720
It's okay. I think I have an idea 
where Hibiki might've gotten lost.

00:12:48.720 --> 00:12:51.360
You guys can go on ahead.

00:12:51.360 --> 00:12:52.520
But...

00:12:52.520 --> 00:12:54.160
It'll be fine.

00:12:55.140 --> 00:12:56.730
It happens all the time.

00:12:59.240 --> 00:13:01.450
I thought this was a terrible morning,

00:13:01.450 --> 00:13:04.770
but I've unexpectedly acquired 
something interesting.

00:13:04.770 --> 00:13:06.180
I can use this.

00:13:06.460 --> 00:13:08.490
<i>If you want your pass case back,</i>

00:13:08.490 --> 00:13:11.000
<i>kneel before me and beg for forgiveness!</i>

00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:12.190
<i>Yes, ma'am!</i>

00:13:12.190 --> 00:13:17.270
<i>I have no idea why you're mad, 
but please forgive my foolishness!</i>

00:13:19.760 --> 00:13:21.260
Now I'm in a great mood!

00:13:21.260 --> 00:13:23.900
With that settled, I need to get to school!

00:13:23.900 --> 00:13:26.400
There's one thing I don't get, though.

00:13:26.400 --> 00:13:30.410
Why does Hibarigaoka carry a 
photo of a sign around with her?

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:32.870
Normally the kind of thing 
you'd put in a pass case...

00:13:34.220 --> 00:13:35.720
is more like this.

00:13:38.870 --> 00:13:40.030
Could it be...

00:13:41.090 --> 00:13:43.550
No, surely not.

00:13:44.160 --> 00:13:46.260
Is that really it?

00:13:49.490 --> 00:13:50.700
This place...

00:13:51.520 --> 00:13:55.140
I know it's a coincidence, 
but it really brings back memories.

00:13:57.630 --> 00:14:00.360
No, it's not a coincidence.

00:13:59.860 --> 00:14:04.780
<b>North Mifune Kindergarten</b>

00:14:00.880 --> 00:14:04.780
This place is where Ren and I made a promise.

00:14:05.400 --> 00:14:08.070
I'm Ekoda Ren. Nice to meet you.

00:14:08.070 --> 00:14:09.530
Nice to meet you!

00:14:10.070 --> 00:14:12.760
Ren-chan, where are you from?

00:14:12.760 --> 00:14:13.500
Far away.

00:14:13.500 --> 00:14:15.410
Your hair is so long and pretty!

00:14:16.560 --> 00:14:17.640
Really?

00:14:21.200 --> 00:14:23.580
Hey, let's be friends!

00:14:23.580 --> 00:14:25.920
No fair! Me, too!

00:14:25.920 --> 00:14:26.640
Okay.

00:14:28.020 --> 00:14:30.170
<i>She's already so popular.</i>

00:14:30.850 --> 00:14:32.060
<i>It's amazing...</i>

00:14:32.060 --> 00:14:34.300
<i>She's surrounded by kids she doesn't know,</i>

00:14:34.300 --> 00:14:36.570
<i>and getting all that attention.</i>

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:40.500
<i>I couldn't handle that.</i>

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:49.820
Let's fold origami today.

00:14:50.470 --> 00:14:51.630
I did it.

00:14:51.630 --> 00:14:52.320
It's a crane.

00:14:55.880 --> 00:14:56.750
A crane?

00:14:58.720 --> 00:15:00.280
Why did you tear it?

00:15:00.280 --> 00:15:01.070
Huh?

00:15:01.800 --> 00:15:07.550
B-Because it was kind of creepy 
and different from everyone else's.

00:15:07.890 --> 00:15:09.160
You think so?

00:15:09.160 --> 00:15:10.050
Huh?

00:15:13.010 --> 00:15:16.430
Um, Ren-chan, did you already finish yours?

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:17.020
Yeah.

00:15:18.740 --> 00:15:19.930
What is it?

00:15:19.930 --> 00:15:20.960
Mt. Fuji.

00:15:20.960 --> 00:15:23.150
What? You can't make that!

00:15:23.450 --> 00:15:25.880
Why not? I folded it.

00:15:25.880 --> 00:15:27.700
Y-Yeah, but...

00:15:28.130 --> 00:15:30.110
At least let me fix it a little.

00:15:30.950 --> 00:15:34.160
Mt. Fuji has a flat top.

00:15:34.160 --> 00:15:36.460
There's a picture of it in my house.

00:15:39.960 --> 00:15:43.830
S-Sorry for touching your origami...

00:15:45.120 --> 00:15:46.800
It's really Mt. Fuji now.

00:15:47.730 --> 00:15:49.760
Thanks, Hibiki.

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:05.110
Good morning.

00:16:06.180 --> 00:16:07.570
Good morning.

00:16:07.570 --> 00:16:10.440
Every morning is a battle 
to get my son out of bed.

00:16:08.330 --> 00:16:12.280
<i>And so we started going 
to kindergarten together...</i>

00:16:10.440 --> 00:16:14.720
The problem in our house is that
Hibiki gets up earlier than I do.

00:16:14.720 --> 00:16:16.740
Wow, that's impressive.

00:16:19.230 --> 00:16:21.160
Aya-chan, you're so pretty!

00:16:26.340 --> 00:16:28.020
What are you making for lunch tomorrow?

00:16:27.250 --> 00:16:28.800
<i>But one day...</i>

00:16:28.020 --> 00:16:33.250
I promised Hibiki I'd make a character lunch 
of the girl in yellow from CurePri.

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:33.510
What is it?

00:16:33.250 --> 00:16:35.980
Wow! I'm only making...

00:16:41.190 --> 00:16:44.140
<i>We got lost.</i>

00:16:48.430 --> 00:16:50.560
Um... Um...

00:16:50.560 --> 00:16:53.020
The kindergarten isn't this way, but...

00:16:53.490 --> 00:16:55.070
Wait... That way?

00:16:55.480 --> 00:16:57.640
I don't recognize anything that way.

00:16:57.640 --> 00:16:58.360
Hey...

00:16:58.360 --> 00:16:59.380
Huh?

00:16:59.380 --> 00:17:02.040
Isn't that the corner where we turn?

00:17:02.690 --> 00:17:04.750
We've been past it a bunch of times.

00:17:04.750 --> 00:17:07.530
Oh, right. That corner...

00:17:07.530 --> 00:17:08.210
No, look...

00:17:11.680 --> 00:17:12.680
It's this way.

00:17:20.880 --> 00:17:22.390
See? We're here.

00:17:23.620 --> 00:17:25.450
You get lost easily.

00:17:27.090 --> 00:17:30.230
From now on, come here when you get lost.

00:17:30.900 --> 00:17:32.820
I'll come find you.

00:17:34.240 --> 00:17:36.170
Th-Thanks.

00:17:37.270 --> 00:17:39.350
They already closed the gate.

00:17:40.520 --> 00:17:42.280
We can get in through here.

00:17:42.280 --> 00:17:42.790
Yeah.

00:17:45.590 --> 00:17:46.620
Ow!

00:17:46.620 --> 00:17:47.470
What's wrong?

00:17:47.470 --> 00:17:48.370
My hair...

00:17:48.800 --> 00:17:50.410
Hibiki-chan?

00:17:50.410 --> 00:17:51.520
Don't move!

00:17:51.520 --> 00:17:52.120
Ren!

00:17:52.120 --> 00:17:52.750
Hibiki!

00:17:54.880 --> 00:17:57.230
It's really stuck in there.

00:17:57.230 --> 00:17:59.590
It'll be hard to get it out.

00:17:59.940 --> 00:18:02.220
Luckily it's just the tip, 
but we'll have to cut it.

00:18:04.020 --> 00:18:07.480
N-No! Don't cut my hair!

00:18:07.900 --> 00:18:10.700
But Hibiki-chan, doesn't it hurt?

00:18:10.700 --> 00:18:13.760
Hibiki, it'll grow out again. It's okay.

00:18:13.760 --> 00:18:14.320
No!

00:18:14.820 --> 00:18:16.280
Why don't you want to cut it?

00:18:16.280 --> 00:18:21.030
B-Because everyone in our class has long hair.

00:18:21.030 --> 00:18:24.170
If you cut it, they'll all think I'm weird.

00:18:24.670 --> 00:18:26.790
And... And...

00:18:47.600 --> 00:18:48.280
Hey.

00:18:55.620 --> 00:18:56.760
Do I look weird?

00:18:58.210 --> 00:19:01.110
N-No. You don't, but...

00:19:02.690 --> 00:19:05.330
Then you'll look good, too.

00:19:18.210 --> 00:19:23.000
<i>After that, my hair was a little shorter,</i>

00:19:23.700 --> 00:19:27.480
<i>and Ren's was a lot shorter.</i>

00:19:33.330 --> 00:19:35.720
I'm surprised I remember.

00:19:35.720 --> 00:19:36.360
Remember what?

00:19:37.470 --> 00:19:39.320
What were you reminiscing about?

00:19:39.320 --> 00:19:41.030
I-It's...

00:19:47.990 --> 00:19:50.820
A memory so wonderful
that I could die, of course!

00:19:52.210 --> 00:19:53.290
You idiot.

00:19:56.660 --> 00:19:58.490
That pass case...

00:19:58.490 --> 00:20:00.280
It's Hibarigaoka's.

00:20:00.280 --> 00:20:01.040
Really?

00:20:01.040 --> 00:20:04.780
She's a terrible person 
who tried to separate us.

00:20:04.780 --> 00:20:06.390
I can't forgive her so easily.

00:20:06.730 --> 00:20:09.800
Oh, you mean the day of the entrance exam?

00:20:09.800 --> 00:20:14.350
But you just got lost on your 
own like you always do.

00:20:15.010 --> 00:20:17.630
Don't be so blunt.

00:20:17.630 --> 00:20:21.750
So are you going to use that to
get even with Hibarigaoka-san?

00:20:26.440 --> 00:20:27.820
I won't use this.

00:20:28.420 --> 00:20:31.130
She'll get what she deserves eventually.

00:20:31.130 --> 00:20:37.340
But if someone trampled on what
was most important to me,

00:20:38.100 --> 00:20:40.730
I would really hate it.

00:20:40.730 --> 00:20:42.470
That's why I'm not using this.

00:20:42.980 --> 00:20:43.850
I see.

00:20:47.320 --> 00:20:52.390
As long as we're going to 
school together, escort me.

00:20:56.770 --> 00:20:57.700
Sure.

00:21:02.180 --> 00:21:03.370
Oh, good.

00:21:03.370 --> 00:21:04.490
They made it.

00:21:04.930 --> 00:21:07.590
Hurry before the teacher gets here.

00:21:09.510 --> 00:21:10.540
Hibarigaoka!

00:21:12.550 --> 00:21:14.790
You just dropped this.

00:21:17.240 --> 00:21:18.330
Did you look?

00:21:18.330 --> 00:21:21.320
At what? I just picked it up a second ago.

00:21:21.320 --> 00:21:23.010
N-Never mind.

00:21:23.640 --> 00:21:24.760
Thanks.

00:21:27.940 --> 00:21:29.510
Ren! Ren!

00:21:29.840 --> 00:21:33.160
I understand now that I need you!

00:21:33.160 --> 00:21:35.640
From now on, we'll go to 
school together every day!

00:21:38.820 --> 00:21:42.400
If you refuse to get up, I'll have to use force...

00:21:46.740 --> 00:21:48.860
I know it's warm out now,

00:21:48.860 --> 00:21:51.140
but you shouldn't sleep with the door open...

00:21:58.480 --> 00:22:00.460
Huh? Hibiki...

00:22:00.460 --> 00:22:02.640
How can you sleep like that?

00:22:02.640 --> 00:22:04.270
You'll hurt yourself!

00:22:04.270 --> 00:22:05.860
No, I—

00:22:07.130 --> 00:22:09.150
Ow...

00:22:09.150 --> 00:22:10.340
You see?

00:22:11.640 --> 00:22:14.060
Looks like you're totally awake now.

00:22:15.100 --> 00:22:18.230
Fine, then. Give me five minutes.

00:22:26.360 --> 00:22:27.240
Okay!

00:22:30.560 --> 00:22:36.090
<i>She shines even brighter now
than she did back then,</i>

00:22:37.170 --> 00:22:41.510
<i>but at least now I can look right back at her.</i>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>May 30</b>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>A Field Trip With Everyone</b>

00:23:39.980 --> 00:23:42.980
<b>Don't miss the next episode!</b>
